    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nThere is no mapping for the recently reworked `:restart` (`ZR` was remapped to `:restart!`, which preserves existing behavior). See #40321\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40321#discussion_r3466637636 proposal for enhanced `ZR`:\n\n> * `count=0` = `:restart`\n> * `count=[1-8]` = \"don't restore session, but DO confirm unsaved changes\"\n> * `count=9` = \"don't restore session, don't confirm unsaved changes\"\n\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-09T11:09:13Z",
