        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> * Saying that `9` does `qall!` necessarily raises the question of what happens at 10+\n\nnot really, there's no precedent for that... and it gets into over-complicated territory.\n\n> That way the destructive command requires intention.\n\nthat is achieved with `9ZR`.",
